## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 1.5 Pro
- **Short description:** Google's original long-context Gemini Pro (released 2024-02-15), the model that introduced the 1M–2M-token window. Now six Gemini generations old.
- **Provider / access:** Google Gemini API / AI Studio (`gemini-1.5-pro`), Vertex AI, plus gateway routes.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2024-02-15 (BenchLM record); knowledge cutoff not published in any source reached.
- **IDs:** `gemini-1.5-pro`, `gemini-1.5-pro-002`, `google/gemini-1.5-pro`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000–2,000,000 tokens depending on version/route (not verified per route in this pass).
- **Modalities:** text, image, audio and video in; text out; tool calls.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** no first-party rate reached in this pass; the model is deprecated on most routes.
- **Architecture:** proprietary sparse MoE (undisclosed).

