## Search notes (why self-excluded)

- BenchLM's profile (`benchlm.ai/models/gemini-1-5-pro`) reports "tracked, but not publicly ranked yet" with **0** sourced benchmark rows.
- models.dev has no entry for this checkpoint (the 1.5 line is absent from the catalog snapshot used for this pass).
- No vendor model card or blog table with numbers was reachable for this exact ID; the widely quoted 1.5 Pro figures in secondary sources refer to mixed versions (`001`/`002`) and preview builds, so transferring them would conflate checkpoints.
- Resolution: no score is asserted rather than guessing; re-run this folder only if a dated, version-specific benchmark table is needed for a legacy comparison.

